  unitName: Ruin Goddess Zellha
  unitId: 50475
  unitNumber: 575
  description: A goddess that wanted to deceive the other gods in order to use them.
    With the desire for the destruction of humanity varying from god to god, she
    headed towards the empire where she herself was tricked by a dark magician. However,
    the one to stop her this time was a god that had already been fooled by her once--Kajah.
    Fueled by his personal grudge against the goddess, he was able to stop her, making
    her flee angrily from the scene. "Thanks to your intrusion, more humans suffered
    than were necessary." were the only words she left behind.
  summonDesc: Ahh!! What's this?!<br>My heart's telling me to obey you!<br> Ugh,
    you Summoners are so annoying!!
  fusionDesc: I might get addicted to this feeling...<br> Hehe.<br> Please cheer
    for me from here on out!
  evoDesc: Look, look!<br> Didn't I get prettier? <br>These are the results of all
    your support!
